00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:32.380
So we're going to click on our control key.

56
00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.200
We're going to note what's written down there.

57
00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:38.260
Enter slash control within, you know, square brackets.

58
00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.600
We're going to type that out.

59
00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:45.560
Square bracket, enter slash CTRL square bracket.

60
00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.440
