which you may need to use from time to time.

97
00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.860
One other thing I want you to be aware of

98
00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:36.760
is when you go to enter in your password

99
00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:40.140
make sure you don't over type the password field here.

100
00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:42.280
It expects eight characters.

101
00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.900
And if you accidentally type in nine characters

102
00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:47.360
and you wind up in the new password field

103
00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.820
over here on the right

104
00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:51.640
it will think that you're trying to make a new password.

105
00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.840
And then when you hit return

106
00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.400
or control or enter or whatever

107
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.920
it'll wind up on this next screen

108
00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:01.600
where it's saying, okay, you gave me a new password

109
00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.960
we'll reenter that password to confirm.

110
00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.880
And you probably didn't mean to do that

111
00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:07.220
and you'll probably get stuck

112
00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:09.560
because you're gonna keep hitting enter

113
00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:11.320
and then you might get locked out.

114
00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:14.860
So make sure you don't over type the password field

115
00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:17.080
and if you do wind up on that screen

116
00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.880
just log out and come back in.

117
00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.860
Let me also say that at least for right now

118
00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:26.620
