119
00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:30.260
or something with a keyboard and a desktop operating system

120
00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.260
to access these systems and do the labs.

121
00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.220
It might work for a while with a mobile device

122
00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:39.900
but we can't guarantee that everything will necessarily work

123
00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:43.500
