132
00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:05.580
but if your ID is revoked and you can't get in

133
00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:08.420
don't worry, we've got this one under control.

134
00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:12.020
So one, make sure you're using the right ID.

135
00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:15.460
Again, it's that ID that's in your course lab kit

136
00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:18.540
and the password is probably also the one

137
00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.580
in your course lab kit.

138
00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:23.620
Two, make sure you're still supposed to have access.

139
00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:27.900
If you let that timer run out, well then there you go.

140
00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:31.420
The good news is you can still click on the lab access

141
00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:35.380
button from the course again and get new access.

142
00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:38.360
The bad news is any work you did before

143
00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.020
will probably be gone.

144
00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.980
So as I said in the first video plan ahead

145
00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.560
and if you need an extension,

146
00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:47.740
ask for that extension before you need it.

147
00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:50.400
The link is in that course lab kit again.

148
00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:55.640
If your access is revoked and you think it's possible

149
00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.840
that you entered a wrong password a couple of times,

150
00:06:58.840 --> 00:06:59.680
