151
00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:03.680
There's a link in the PDF on your desktop called IDSS.

152
00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.840
Follow the link in there and it'll send you to a page

153
00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:11.120
where you can reset your password and resume your ID.

154
00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.160
Now, for security purposes,

155
00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.440
that link only works on that virtual system.

156
00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:18.480
You can't use it on your own computer.

157
00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.880
So click on it from the PDF

158
00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.360
and then enter the super secret code

159
00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:26.480
at the bottom of your personal course lab kit

160
00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:28.360
that will resume your account.

161
00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:31.400
Once it's resumed, you can attempt to log back

162
00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:34.720
into the system with the same password that's in,

163
00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.960
you got it, your course lab kit.

164
00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:39.960
And if you tried all of that and you still can't get in

165
00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:42.840
