168
00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.120
and try to solve your problem.

169
00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:50.400
That's a lot of information.

170
00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.400
Hopefully you know what to do, what not to do

171
00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.000
and what to look out for.

172
00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.840
We wanna make sure you have a real good time learning

173
00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.000
